WEBVTT

01:30.390 --> 01:34.860
[The Unclouded Soul]

01:35.170 --> 01:37.670
[Episode 25]

01:54.640 --> 01:55.950
So back then, the Heavenly Mother

01:55.950 --> 01:57.400
used the Heart-Burning Incantation

01:57.400 --> 01:59.600
and activated an array to reverse time.

01:59.640 --> 02:01.340
It was to bring herself back
to the beginning of time

02:01.340 --> 02:02.890
to find her younger self

02:02.940 --> 02:06.140
to retrieve her primordial spirit
and restore her power.

02:06.310 --> 02:07.590
Did she succeed?

02:08.680 --> 02:09.410
I don't know.

02:09.840 --> 02:10.630
This stone only

02:10.630 --> 02:12.800
shows the Heavenly Mother
entering the array,

02:12.800 --> 02:14.390
but nothing after that.

02:15.000 --> 02:15.960
So

02:16.340 --> 02:17.870
we don't know if she returned

02:17.870 --> 02:19.690
or if she recovered her power.

02:20.910 --> 02:21.360
We don't know.

02:21.360 --> 02:21.820
Gosh...

02:27.060 --> 02:28.720
The Time-Reversal Technique

02:29.000 --> 02:31.630
is the only technique
no one dares to use lightly

02:31.630 --> 02:34.090
despite it
not being a forbidden technique.

02:34.800 --> 02:36.480
Once you use this technique,

02:36.910 --> 02:37.770
those who enter

02:38.270 --> 02:40.070
will return to their fetal state

02:40.560 --> 02:43.890
without their memories or power
when traveling to the past.

02:44.450 --> 02:45.450
In the Six Realms,

02:46.150 --> 02:48.410
both humans and demons are no exception.

02:48.590 --> 02:50.560
Only an extraordinary being
like the Heavenly Mother

02:50.560 --> 02:51.690
can enter the array.

02:52.000 --> 02:54.130
And even so, the outcome is uncertain.

02:59.190 --> 02:59.850
Never mind.

03:01.960 --> 03:04.160
It was just a desperate attempt anyway.

03:10.630 --> 03:12.310
I'm a human and also a demon.

03:12.310 --> 03:14.370
Which of the six realms do I belong to?

03:16.260 --> 03:16.960
Right!

03:17.990 --> 03:19.710
Xiao Yao is half human and half demon,

03:19.710 --> 03:21.510
not belonging to any of the six realms.

03:21.510 --> 03:23.800
She could enter the array
and return to the past

03:23.800 --> 03:26.200
without her physical form being affected.

03:26.390 --> 03:27.190
That's great!

03:27.190 --> 03:28.280
If I go back,

03:28.280 --> 03:29.680
how far back can I travel?

03:30.470 --> 03:33.910
His Lordship's primordial spirit
was injured a hundred years ago.

03:33.910 --> 03:36.000
If you want to retrieve the
true primordial spirit,

03:36.000 --> 03:37.660
you must go back even further.

03:39.590 --> 03:40.500
Then wouldn't I

03:40.530 --> 03:43.060
be able to see His Lordship
as he was back then?

03:44.890 --> 03:46.800
I wonder if he was more handsome then

03:46.800 --> 03:48.400
or if he's more handsome now.

03:49.079 --> 03:50.800
He was and is handsome at both times.

03:50.800 --> 03:52.000
Stop fooling around.

03:53.170 --> 03:55.500
How can I retrieve the primordial spirit?

03:57.470 --> 03:59.800
Would I also be able to see

03:59.800 --> 04:00.900
Princess Ning'an?

04:04.130 --> 04:05.080
This is hardly the time

04:05.080 --> 04:06.210
to be joking around.

04:07.230 --> 04:08.350
I'm just curious.

04:09.030 --> 04:12.000
Let's forget about
retrieving the primordial spirit.

04:12.000 --> 04:12.840
Look at you,

04:12.930 --> 04:14.750
bringing up exactly what you shouldn't.

04:14.750 --> 04:15.470
My Lord!

04:15.590 --> 04:16.600
Don't be angry!

04:19.430 --> 04:20.680
Why is he angry?

04:24.560 --> 04:25.190
My Lord.

04:26.680 --> 04:28.280
Sending Xiao Yao back in time

04:28.920 --> 04:30.700
might be the only way
to restore her spiritual power.

04:30.700 --> 04:32.920
Even if that were the only way,

04:33.940 --> 04:35.800
she can't go back, no matter what.

04:35.830 --> 04:37.370
But we have to at least try.

04:37.680 --> 04:39.280
What if she never comes back?

04:39.560 --> 04:40.310
My Lord.

04:44.610 --> 04:46.540
So what
if I never recover my power?

04:47.159 --> 04:48.620
Don't mention this again.

04:51.280 --> 04:53.610
My Lord, are you afraid
of facing the past,

04:53.870 --> 04:55.400
or afraid of facing Xiao Yao

04:55.530 --> 04:57.460
once she learns the truth about it?

05:00.270 --> 05:01.000
Or perhaps

05:02.980 --> 05:04.640
you fear that if Xiao Yao goes,

05:04.830 --> 05:06.760
she may never return to this world.

05:17.640 --> 05:19.590
[Residence of the Bulwark Duke]

05:21.800 --> 05:23.860
The imperial decree has been issued.

05:23.900 --> 05:26.160
War between the two races is inevitable.

05:26.360 --> 05:28.420
This isn't about giving you a choice,

05:29.940 --> 05:32.940
but offering you
a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity.

05:48.720 --> 05:51.010
But now is not the right time for war.

05:51.030 --> 05:52.940
Hong Ye has returned to Demons' Valley

05:52.940 --> 05:54.870
with the ancient mirror fragment.

05:54.960 --> 05:56.530
He also drove away Heiwu.

05:56.710 --> 05:58.860
The demons must all be united now.

05:59.080 --> 06:00.610
Meanwhile, the Feiyu Guard

06:01.110 --> 06:02.480
has divided loyalties

06:03.800 --> 06:05.240
and scattered minds.

06:05.830 --> 06:08.560
Didn't you vow to eliminate all demons?

06:10.510 --> 06:11.120
Why?

06:13.790 --> 06:15.990
Now you have a legitimate reason to act,

06:16.520 --> 06:18.240
yet you hesitate.

06:19.330 --> 06:20.330
But not all demons

06:21.830 --> 06:23.800
deserve to die.

06:24.070 --> 06:26.670
You're afraid of hurting Xiao Yao,
aren't you?

06:30.400 --> 06:32.460
Xiao Yao only has Hong Ye in her heart,

06:33.010 --> 06:34.840
never you, not even a little.

06:35.920 --> 06:37.360
You should face reality.

06:38.560 --> 06:40.159
It's not just about Xiao Yao.

06:40.680 --> 06:42.540
I, Bingzhu, have a heart and eyes.

06:42.540 --> 06:43.710
I can see that

06:43.730 --> 06:45.700
not every demon is evil.

06:47.710 --> 06:48.990
You have a heart.

06:51.070 --> 06:53.920
So you can connect
with those who have hearts.

06:56.370 --> 06:57.530
I have no heart,

07:01.960 --> 07:04.690
so I can only hide in this tiny space
day after day,

07:08.050 --> 07:09.930
making you avoid me

07:12.040 --> 07:13.680
as if I were a plague.

07:13.680 --> 07:16.410
That's not what I meant.
How could you think that—

07:23.620 --> 07:25.000
It's all my fault.

07:30.600 --> 07:31.510
Why don't

07:34.070 --> 07:35.909
you ask Tan'er what to do?

07:51.870 --> 07:54.960
I've given you more than one chance
to get rid of me

07:56.590 --> 07:59.020
to keep the Lu Pianpian you once knew.

08:01.530 --> 08:04.370
But you can neither take action
nor let go.

08:06.240 --> 08:08.240
Now there's no chance left.

08:21.640 --> 08:23.640
Lu Pianpian doesn't exist anymore.

08:25.560 --> 08:27.630
Only the Dreamshard Immortal does.

08:37.350 --> 08:39.059
The situation now forces you

08:39.880 --> 08:42.940
to lead the Feiyu Guard
into battle against the demons.

08:46.290 --> 08:48.010
And you must win.

08:53.600 --> 08:54.460
The Feiyu Guard

08:54.560 --> 08:56.560
would like to see the Immortal Lord!

08:59.110 --> 08:59.970
Hide yourself.

09:01.200 --> 09:02.260
I'll hold them off.

09:11.150 --> 09:12.410
Why have you come here?

09:16.560 --> 09:17.610
Speak up.

09:19.450 --> 09:22.850
The Feiyu Guard would like to ask
the Immortal Lord to replace our hearts.

09:22.850 --> 09:24.480
We will serve the Immortal Lord.

09:24.480 --> 09:25.810
-Go back!
-And spare no effort,

09:25.810 --> 09:27.140
with absolute loyalty!

09:27.630 --> 09:29.080
Spare no effort,

09:29.080 --> 09:30.470
with absolute loyalty.

09:30.790 --> 09:32.330
Spare no effort,

09:32.430 --> 09:33.760
with absolute loyalty.

09:34.120 --> 09:35.550
Spare no effort,

09:35.550 --> 09:36.880
with absolute loyalty.

09:37.200 --> 09:38.630
Spare no effort,

09:38.630 --> 09:40.000
with absolute loyalty.

09:45.960 --> 09:47.560
If your hearts are replaced,

09:47.980 --> 09:49.430
you'll become demons.

09:50.510 --> 09:51.510
Have you all

09:51.750 --> 09:53.140
made up your minds?

09:54.280 --> 09:56.500
I checked the Feiyu Guard records.

09:57.510 --> 10:00.550
A colleague once received
a heart transplant from the Immortal Lord

10:00.550 --> 10:02.720
and gained immense power,
able to fight a hundred enemies alone.

10:02.720 --> 10:05.240
Now the Emperor has given us
a one-month deadline.

10:05.240 --> 10:06.790
If we don't eliminate the demons,

10:06.790 --> 10:08.120
all Feiyu Guards will be executed

10:08.120 --> 10:09.850
and our families will also die.

10:11.790 --> 10:13.520
Rather than waiting for death,

10:14.440 --> 10:16.770
we might as well become demons ourselves.

10:18.270 --> 10:19.950
We beg you to help us,

10:20.150 --> 10:21.290
and save our lives.

10:21.720 --> 10:23.180
Thank you, Immortal Lord.

10:28.320 --> 10:31.460
[Cloud-Reaching Loyalty]

10:36.290 --> 10:39.930
[Yunmeng Lake]

11:07.400 --> 11:08.200
Demon Lord?

11:09.460 --> 11:10.720
Sea Turtle Demon Lord?

11:11.730 --> 11:13.000
Sea Turtle Demon Lord?

11:13.930 --> 11:15.990
Sea Turtle Demon Lord, are you there?

11:16.600 --> 11:18.460
Demon Lord, are you slacking off?

11:18.720 --> 11:20.780
Neglecting your duties, Demon Lord?

11:30.790 --> 11:31.570
Demon Lord?

11:32.390 --> 11:33.060
Demon Lord?

11:33.910 --> 11:35.170
Demon Lord, over here!

11:35.550 --> 11:35.960
Here!

11:36.360 --> 11:39.820
I haven't been disturbed
for a thousand years.

11:39.910 --> 11:40.960
Who are you?

11:42.360 --> 11:43.490
I'm Heiwu.

11:43.790 --> 11:45.580
I didn't mean to disturb
your peaceful rest.

11:45.580 --> 11:46.120
What?

11:46.270 --> 11:47.130
Peaceful rest?

11:47.350 --> 11:49.750
[Sea Turtle]

11:47.600 --> 11:51.120
Are you implying that I'm being lazy?

11:51.670 --> 11:53.030
Please don't be angry,
Demon Lord!

11:53.030 --> 11:55.750
It's just that the Demon King
is concerned for all demons.

11:55.750 --> 11:57.820
Lately, he's been feeling anxious.

11:58.070 --> 12:00.030
He fears a calamity might befall us.

12:00.030 --> 12:01.030
And since Yunmeng Lake

12:01.030 --> 12:03.500
is the most crucial demon seal,

12:03.720 --> 12:05.080
he specifically sent me here

12:05.080 --> 12:07.080
to check if the seal remains intact.

12:07.390 --> 12:09.060
Should we go up and talk?

12:10.000 --> 12:12.130
If there were any issues with the seal,

12:12.240 --> 12:14.670
I would be the first to know.

12:14.840 --> 12:16.590
Why would I need you to tell me?

12:16.870 --> 12:19.400
I understand
the Demon King worries too much.

12:19.960 --> 12:20.620
Demon Lord,

12:20.960 --> 12:22.520
could you give me a hand?

12:24.480 --> 12:25.640
Fine, fine.

12:26.270 --> 12:29.170
Since you're just following orders.

12:31.150 --> 12:32.270
He sank.

12:33.360 --> 12:34.750
He sank!

12:39.120 --> 12:39.720
Let's go.

12:39.720 --> 12:40.150
Yes.

12:41.350 --> 12:42.770
Come on, class is over.

12:48.350 --> 12:50.290
All demons have

12:50.630 --> 12:53.160
their subjects and characteristics listed,

12:53.750 --> 12:55.750
so why doesn't Hong Ye have any?

12:56.790 --> 12:58.390
He's a mighty Demon King...

12:58.390 --> 12:59.600
Xiao Yao, let's go.

13:01.060 --> 13:02.120
What are you doing?

13:03.610 --> 13:05.010
Let me ask you something.

13:05.280 --> 13:08.610
Have any of you been in human form
for over one hundred years?

13:10.270 --> 13:11.420
The older ones

13:11.480 --> 13:13.110
were mostly slaughtered.

13:13.670 --> 13:16.270
What are you trying to find out
from a hundred years ago?

13:16.270 --> 13:16.730
Well...

13:17.170 --> 13:18.970
If the demon books don't have it,

13:19.080 --> 13:20.320
human books might.

13:21.070 --> 13:21.870
That's right!

13:22.490 --> 13:24.290
I'll go check in the human realm.

13:26.240 --> 13:27.300
Keep this a secret.

13:27.550 --> 13:28.010
Mm-hmm.

13:28.390 --> 13:28.900
Mm-hmm.

13:32.100 --> 13:33.320
Did I say something wrong?

13:33.320 --> 13:33.840
No.

13:34.360 --> 13:34.790
Right?

13:34.790 --> 13:35.240
Yeah.

13:39.550 --> 13:40.930
These creatures

13:40.970 --> 13:42.960
are all suppressed by seals.

13:43.490 --> 13:44.320
Look,

13:44.530 --> 13:46.320
those ripples

13:46.720 --> 13:49.460
and bubbles coming up

13:49.600 --> 13:52.460
are caused by their breath.

13:53.510 --> 13:55.570
The seals are very secure.

13:55.990 --> 13:57.610
With me here,

13:57.840 --> 14:00.030
even if sealed
for ten thousand more years,

14:00.030 --> 14:01.650
nothing will go wrong.

14:02.240 --> 14:03.700
Under what circumstances

14:03.790 --> 14:05.140
would the seal loosen?

14:08.000 --> 14:09.300
The seal is secure

14:09.440 --> 14:10.870
and has never loosened.

14:10.900 --> 14:14.570
Didn't you come to check
if the seal was secure?

14:14.600 --> 14:16.540
Now that you've confirmed it's fine,

14:16.540 --> 14:18.570
you may go back and report.

14:20.440 --> 14:21.840
Please wait, Demon Lord.

14:22.100 --> 14:24.670
His Lordship is too busy
to visit you in person,

14:24.670 --> 14:25.830
so he specifically sent me

14:25.830 --> 14:26.740
to bring you a gift.

14:25.930 --> 14:28.100
[Ming] [Qing]

14:28.830 --> 14:30.050
Qing Ming.

14:29.860 --> 14:30.690
[Qing] [Ming]

14:30.180 --> 14:31.460
Ming Qing.

14:30.710 --> 14:31.660
[Qing] [Ming]

14:36.320 --> 14:37.360
Ming Qing.

14:38.750 --> 14:42.280
This is truly excellent wine.

14:43.030 --> 14:44.890
I brought this wine specifically

14:45.000 --> 14:47.390
as it matches your namesake festival.

15:01.840 --> 15:03.080
I've never tasted

15:03.100 --> 15:05.290
wine with such a flavor before.

15:06.240 --> 15:07.030
I wonder

15:07.600 --> 15:09.360
how it was brewed?

15:10.000 --> 15:12.260
Do you know about toad venom, Demon Lord?

15:12.960 --> 15:14.030
Toad venom?

15:14.070 --> 15:14.550
Yeah.

15:18.510 --> 15:20.820
You're testing me?

15:21.200 --> 15:22.550
Toad venom,

15:23.150 --> 15:24.480
it clouds the mind

15:24.750 --> 15:26.350
and causes hallucinations.

15:36.670 --> 15:38.720
You're trying to poison me?

15:44.550 --> 15:46.810
Wine is a poison that penetrates the gut,

15:47.030 --> 15:49.890
but only drunkenness
can solve a thousand worries.

15:50.080 --> 15:51.320
Ordinary wine

15:51.340 --> 15:53.770
could never ease the troubles
of a Demon Lord like you.

15:53.770 --> 15:55.450
Only this toad venom brew can.

15:59.480 --> 16:00.080
I like it.

16:00.600 --> 16:01.270
Good wine.

16:02.180 --> 16:03.640
A toast to you, Demon Lord.

16:04.440 --> 16:04.910
Cheers.

16:16.770 --> 16:18.200
May I ask,

16:18.370 --> 16:19.510
in this world,
is it only you

16:19.510 --> 16:20.840
who can break this seal?

16:22.750 --> 16:24.120
Actually,

16:24.440 --> 16:27.510
I'm not the only one who can break it.

16:28.550 --> 16:29.810
The Celestial Dragon,

16:30.080 --> 16:31.310
Earth Emperor,

16:31.480 --> 16:33.240
heart blood,

16:33.720 --> 16:34.780
and also

16:34.910 --> 16:36.940
the most important...

16:41.840 --> 16:42.500
The most...

16:42.510 --> 16:44.710
What is the most important, Demon Lord?

16:45.240 --> 16:46.900
What is the Celestial Dragon?

16:47.320 --> 16:48.980
And what is the Earth Emperor?

16:52.870 --> 16:54.810
Why are you asking

16:55.970 --> 16:57.430
such specific questions?

17:16.030 --> 17:16.910
With this!

17:19.430 --> 17:21.450
Along with Celestial Dragon,

17:21.550 --> 17:23.730
which is Celestial Water.

17:24.349 --> 17:25.349
The Earth Emperor

17:25.589 --> 17:27.790
is Underground Fire.

17:27.790 --> 17:30.160
Along with heart blood,

17:30.160 --> 17:33.080
all flowing into this array.

17:33.230 --> 17:34.070
May I ask...

17:37.590 --> 17:38.250
Demon Lord?

17:40.880 --> 17:42.540
Would you like another drink?

17:42.880 --> 17:43.650
Demon Lord.

17:48.500 --> 17:49.190
Demon Lord.

17:52.110 --> 17:53.030
Demon Lord.

18:02.680 --> 18:03.680
Celestial Water.

18:04.910 --> 18:06.220
Underground Fire.

18:07.130 --> 18:08.480
Heart blood.

18:10.290 --> 18:11.610
Thank you, Demon Lord.

18:33.920 --> 18:35.470
Celestial Water.

19:02.550 --> 19:04.440
Celestial Water.

19:14.530 --> 19:16.210
Underground Fire.

19:34.340 --> 19:35.840
Underground Fire.

20:12.100 --> 20:13.500
[Tianwei Gate]

20:34.350 --> 20:43.860
[Tianwei Gate]

20:39.680 --> 20:42.260
The demons
have plagued our world for too long.

20:42.260 --> 20:43.960
I bear the weight
of seven ancestral temples,

20:43.960 --> 20:45.640
to safeguard peace throughout the realm.

20:45.640 --> 20:49.040
I must do more than
merely preserve the imperial succession.

20:49.350 --> 20:51.510
The late emperor established
the Feiyu Guard

20:51.510 --> 20:53.440
to eliminate demons and monsters.

20:54.020 --> 20:56.220
But our old methods of capturing demons

20:56.240 --> 20:58.370
are no longer sufficient for the task.

20:59.250 --> 21:00.640
A campaign against the demon realm

21:00.640 --> 21:02.190
is now imperative!

21:02.790 --> 21:03.740
Today,

21:03.790 --> 21:05.240
the nine provinces are filled with vigor,

21:05.240 --> 21:06.830
and the heavens stand ready.

21:06.830 --> 21:08.000
I offer fine wine

21:08.000 --> 21:10.560
to send off all our warriors.

21:11.960 --> 21:13.200
May you all

21:13.790 --> 21:15.450
be victorious in every battle

21:15.650 --> 21:17.050
and return in triumph!

21:17.730 --> 21:21.700
[Tianwei Gate]

21:50.980 --> 21:52.710
Greetings, Exalted Immortal.

21:53.710 --> 21:55.530
Greetings, Exalted Immortal.

21:55.920 --> 21:57.650
Greetings, Exalted Immortal.

22:36.830 --> 22:38.140
No, no!

22:38.270 --> 22:39.720
If the Evil Demon appears,

22:39.720 --> 22:42.220
it'll be a catastrophe!

22:59.030 --> 23:01.510
This wine is perfect for today's occasion:

23:01.510 --> 23:02.840
the Qingming Festival.

23:03.640 --> 23:04.550
Demon Lord,

23:05.310 --> 23:06.630
farewell.

23:16.400 --> 23:17.830
Destroy the old world,

23:18.030 --> 23:19.490
and establish a new order!

23:19.780 --> 23:20.720
The demons

23:21.960 --> 23:25.310
will be all mine now!

23:31.750 --> 23:33.710
The world has fallen into chaos,

23:33.820 --> 23:37.610
[Tianwei Gate]

23:33.950 --> 23:35.610
and catastrophe is imminent.

23:40.330 --> 23:42.550
If you can seize this opportunity
to eliminate the demons,

23:42.550 --> 23:44.040
and establish extraordinary merit,

23:44.040 --> 23:46.900
the immortals
will naturally grant you longevity.

23:48.440 --> 23:50.100
I am willing to lead the charge

23:50.700 --> 23:52.900
with all the might of Tiansheng Kingdom

23:54.040 --> 23:55.440
to eliminate the demons!

23:55.710 --> 23:57.130
As ruler of the kingdom,

23:57.620 --> 23:59.430
you must not leave the imperial city.

23:59.430 --> 24:01.590
If you move,
the realm will fall into chaos.

24:01.590 --> 24:02.110
Then...

24:03.200 --> 24:05.200
please guide us, Exalted Immortal,

24:05.640 --> 24:07.860
how can we ensure victory for humanity?

24:07.920 --> 24:10.400
Though immortals
cannot meddle in mortal affairs,

24:10.400 --> 24:12.660
your sincerity is rare and commendable.

24:13.250 --> 24:14.530
Give the military tally

24:14.530 --> 24:15.930
to Bingzhu.

24:16.320 --> 24:18.680
The army shall follow his commands,

24:19.140 --> 24:21.310
and I have my ways to ensure victory.

24:21.620 --> 24:24.680
Everything shall be
as the Exalted Immortal commands!

24:27.710 --> 24:29.330
With the Exalted Immortal's assistance,

24:28.610 --> 24:32.320
[Tianwei Gate]

24:29.950 --> 24:32.280
you must seize this opportunity to settle

24:32.900 --> 24:35.960
the thousand-year conflict
between humans and demons

24:36.030 --> 24:38.050
with this final battle!

24:38.110 --> 24:41.290
We will obey the royal command
and eliminate the demons!

24:41.350 --> 24:44.350
We will obey the royal command
and eliminate the demons!

24:44.350 --> 24:45.790
Eliminate the demons!

24:45.830 --> 24:47.160
Eliminate the demons!

24:47.230 --> 24:48.770
Eliminate the demons!

24:48.830 --> 24:50.270
Eliminate the demons!

24:50.310 --> 24:51.720
Eliminate the demons!

24:51.740 --> 24:53.210
Eliminate the demons!

24:54.140 --> 24:58.330
[History Record]

24:58.430 --> 25:01.380
[In the 248th year of the Tiansheng Era,]

25:01.450 --> 25:04.830
[History Record]

25:04.910 --> 25:06.830
[the great demon Hong Ye
brought calamity upon the mortal realm.]

25:06.900 --> 25:14.030
[History Record]

25:12.960 --> 25:15.090
In the 248th year of the Tiansheng Era,

25:15.590 --> 25:16.790
the great demon Hong Ye

25:16.790 --> 25:18.680
brought calamity upon the mortal realm.

25:18.680 --> 25:20.070
He once attacked the imperial city,

25:20.070 --> 25:21.670
injuring countless people.

25:22.750 --> 25:24.200
Fortunately, Princess Ning'an

25:24.200 --> 25:25.340
devised a strategy

25:25.550 --> 25:27.410
to trap the demon
within an array.

25:28.200 --> 25:29.990
Hong Ye fought desperately,

25:30.270 --> 25:32.750
but Princess Ning'an,
with her noble heart,

25:32.960 --> 25:34.960
sacrificed herself along with the demon,

25:34.960 --> 25:37.090
ensuring peace for all living beings.

25:45.270 --> 25:48.530
[Princess Ning'an]

25:51.830 --> 25:52.780
What is this?

25:53.070 --> 25:54.200
It's an auspicious sign from heaven,

25:54.200 --> 25:56.530
with Buddha's light shining everywhere!

25:58.080 --> 26:00.140
What nonsense are you talking about?

26:01.200 --> 26:02.940
This is clearly an omen of disaster!

26:02.940 --> 26:03.630
Nonsense!

26:05.280 --> 26:06.240
The purple aura fills the sky,

26:06.240 --> 26:08.040
it must be a sign of good fortune!

26:08.110 --> 26:11.040
The true dragon appears and
the great demon emerges.

26:11.560 --> 26:13.290
All living beings will suffer!

26:13.720 --> 26:14.880
Suffering...

26:15.270 --> 26:17.080
Suffering is upon us!

26:17.350 --> 26:19.800
What do we do now?

26:39.000 --> 26:39.550
My Lord.

26:41.280 --> 26:43.140
The Demon Lord's token is broken.

26:43.160 --> 26:45.600
Something terrible has happened
at Yunmeng Lake.

26:45.600 --> 26:47.790
Legend says great demons
are sealed in Yunmeng Lake.

26:47.790 --> 26:48.720
Could it be true?

26:49.510 --> 26:50.000
Yes.

26:50.740 --> 26:51.830
But in the ancient demon texts,

26:51.830 --> 26:53.410
why is there no record of this?

26:53.410 --> 26:55.720
The ancient great demons' power
is too strong.

26:55.720 --> 26:56.480
They feared it might be

26:56.480 --> 26:58.550
exploited
by ill-intentioned humans or demons.

26:58.550 --> 26:59.440
So it was guarded by

26:59.440 --> 27:02.040
Sea Turtle,
the longest-living of the demons.

27:03.440 --> 27:04.240
Is their power

27:04.440 --> 27:05.520
more powerful than My Lord?

27:05.520 --> 27:06.750
Even if I had my power,

27:07.730 --> 27:09.170
I may not be their match.

27:10.750 --> 27:11.440
They?

27:13.720 --> 27:15.320
There are three great demons

27:15.720 --> 27:17.050
sealed in Yunmeng Lake.

27:25.560 --> 27:27.210
It's really like the omen.

27:29.250 --> 27:31.250
The tribulation of demons has come.

27:36.750 --> 27:37.270
My Lord,

27:38.480 --> 27:39.940
at such a critical moment,

27:41.060 --> 27:44.120
are you still not going to use
the Time-Reversal Array?

27:45.720 --> 27:48.580
Even if you can't retrieve
your primordial spirit,

27:49.280 --> 27:50.040
at least

27:51.440 --> 27:52.840
you can send Xiao Yao away

27:53.210 --> 27:54.140
and protect her.

28:31.010 --> 28:32.650
I am the one who broke the seal

28:33.030 --> 28:34.960
and allowed you to see daylight again.

28:34.960 --> 28:36.720
From now on, you must obey my commands

28:36.720 --> 28:37.800
and help me become

28:38.000 --> 28:39.960
the Monarch of All Demons.

29:00.680 --> 29:02.100
With me, Qiong Qi, around,

29:01.680 --> 29:03.690
[Qiong Qi]

29:02.350 --> 29:03.810
who dares claim to be king?

29:05.630 --> 29:07.540
Don't pollute my ears.

29:08.670 --> 29:10.700
Are all demons dead?

29:09.150 --> 29:11.880
[Ao Hen]

29:11.300 --> 29:13.240
You're nothing but a stray beast,

29:14.680 --> 29:16.410
yet you dare to claim kingship?

29:17.330 --> 29:18.170
Ao Hen.

29:18.880 --> 29:20.100
You're asking for death.

29:20.100 --> 29:21.540
I'm afraid the one

29:21.880 --> 29:22.940
who will die is you!

29:30.170 --> 29:31.600
I've been asleep for so long,

29:31.600 --> 29:34.150
[Teng She]

29:31.920 --> 29:34.380
why all this talk of death
as soon as I wake up?

29:35.800 --> 29:37.010
Put it out.

29:38.360 --> 29:39.100
Be good.

29:40.550 --> 29:42.800
Is there nothing else to do?

29:44.890 --> 29:46.340
Don't stoop to his level.

29:53.030 --> 29:54.270
Little bat?

30:02.490 --> 30:03.460
Let me ask you.

30:04.440 --> 30:05.200
You

30:05.490 --> 30:07.620
released the three of us from the seal?

30:11.310 --> 30:12.640
This kid isn't very old,

30:13.280 --> 30:14.940
but his ambition is not small.

30:15.200 --> 30:17.400
He wants to be the Monarch of All Demons.

30:21.680 --> 30:23.830
Whoever dares to claim to be Demon King

30:24.810 --> 30:26.220
will die quickly!

30:29.330 --> 30:30.240
Did your clan's leader

30:30.240 --> 30:31.440
never teach you this?

30:34.070 --> 30:35.110
Little beast.

30:35.720 --> 30:36.520
Let me ask you,

30:37.240 --> 30:39.500
do you know how many years we were sealed?

30:41.250 --> 30:42.720
You were sealed for a thousand years.

30:42.720 --> 30:44.180
It was ten thousand years!

30:44.550 --> 30:46.750
Ten thousand! Yes, ten thousand years!

30:47.220 --> 30:48.580
I broke the seal

30:49.160 --> 30:50.000
intending to give the world—

30:50.000 --> 30:50.590
Kneel!

30:51.980 --> 30:52.980
Back to you three.

30:53.370 --> 30:54.720
You'd better be honest.

30:55.360 --> 30:57.260
Don't use those bewitching words

30:58.100 --> 30:59.280
to use us

31:00.000 --> 31:01.930
to conquer the world for yourself.

31:14.270 --> 31:16.760
I, Aohen, do know how to repay kindness.

31:18.950 --> 31:20.480
If you know what's good for you,

31:20.480 --> 31:21.920
we may help you a little.

31:22.920 --> 31:23.720
Otherwise,

31:24.310 --> 31:25.970
we'll first destroy your clan

31:26.000 --> 31:28.060
then devour your primordial spirit.

31:28.430 --> 31:29.250
Understand?

31:29.400 --> 31:30.240
Yes, I understand.

31:30.240 --> 31:31.300
Yes, I understand.

31:44.860 --> 31:46.280
I am useless.

31:47.350 --> 31:48.120
The demons

31:48.500 --> 31:50.900
are facing an unprecedented catastrophe.

31:50.940 --> 31:52.800
I had no choice but to release—

31:54.590 --> 31:55.580
To release...

31:59.710 --> 32:00.780
the three of you

32:01.640 --> 32:03.440
to eliminate the rebellious Demon King

32:03.440 --> 32:04.900
and slaughter all humans.

32:06.720 --> 32:07.720
Is there

32:07.840 --> 32:08.900
a Demon King now?

32:09.880 --> 32:10.270
Yes.

32:10.750 --> 32:11.590
Who?

32:12.440 --> 32:13.070
Hong Ye.

32:24.120 --> 32:25.810
Hong Ye colluded with humans,

32:25.920 --> 32:28.120
offering demons to humans for alchemy.

32:28.190 --> 32:29.850
If you three don't intervene,

32:30.980 --> 32:32.150
our demon race

32:32.460 --> 32:34.210
is about to be slaughtered.

32:40.070 --> 32:41.310
Where is Hong Ye?

32:43.550 --> 32:44.550
I'll lead the way.

32:52.570 --> 32:54.160
My goodness, you're finally back.

32:54.160 --> 32:55.320
Quick, come with me.

32:57.200 --> 32:58.240
What happened?

32:58.360 --> 33:01.400
His Lordship has agreed to use
the Time-Reversal Technique.

33:01.400 --> 33:03.060
Hurry, we'll be too late soon.

33:03.580 --> 33:06.560
Is Princess Ning'an more powerful
than the Dreamshard Immortal?

33:06.560 --> 33:08.850
Otherwise how could she have hurt Hong Ye?

33:08.850 --> 33:10.220
Is Ning'an a bad person?

33:10.680 --> 33:12.070
You all say I look like her.

33:12.070 --> 33:13.970
Someone who looks like this
shouldn't be bad, right?

33:13.970 --> 33:14.590
But...

33:15.270 --> 33:16.510
I don't know the answer

33:16.510 --> 33:18.970
to these questions
you're asking me either.

33:19.050 --> 33:20.160
The Time-Reversal array

33:20.160 --> 33:22.000
has never been activated before.

33:22.000 --> 33:24.130
Besides, I've never gone back either.

33:24.960 --> 33:25.790
Moreover,

33:26.640 --> 33:27.800
with my power,

33:27.830 --> 33:29.270
I can only activate the array

33:29.270 --> 33:30.470
to send you in.

33:30.720 --> 33:32.910
But as for when and where you'll end up,

33:33.070 --> 33:34.220
I have no idea.

33:34.240 --> 33:35.570
It's up to your own fate.

33:37.400 --> 33:38.590
What if I'm sent to

33:38.590 --> 33:40.720
an ancient volcanic crater?

33:40.720 --> 33:42.050
That's unpredictable.

33:42.920 --> 33:44.320
So do you still want to go?

33:44.350 --> 33:44.910
Yes,

33:45.030 --> 33:46.310
I'll go even if
there's only a glimmer of hope.

33:46.310 --> 33:47.730
Then let's hurry.

34:03.200 --> 34:03.880
Xiao Yao.

34:05.480 --> 34:06.340
Remember this.

34:07.720 --> 34:10.050
Fortune and misfortune are predestined.

34:10.840 --> 34:11.900
If you face danger,

34:13.730 --> 34:14.929
don't push yourself.

34:17.550 --> 34:17.960
Yes.

34:19.800 --> 34:20.880
Come here.

34:40.900 --> 34:41.650
Let's begin.

34:42.920 --> 34:43.360
Yes.

35:13.420 --> 35:15.750
I will bring your primordial spirit back.

35:17.360 --> 35:17.760
Yes.

35:32.800 --> 35:33.370
My Lord.

35:38.890 --> 35:39.890
Don't lose focus.

35:40.850 --> 35:41.370
Yes.

35:54.950 --> 35:55.640
Xiao Yao,

35:57.030 --> 35:58.190
come back safely.

36:00.580 --> 36:01.270
Wait for me.

36:21.840 --> 36:22.440
Xiao Ming.

36:22.790 --> 36:23.650
Gather the demons

36:23.650 --> 36:24.910
and go to Youning Cave.

36:25.150 --> 36:26.550
Seal the entrance with a barrier.

36:26.550 --> 36:27.010
My Lord.

36:27.030 --> 36:27.510
Hurry!

36:28.880 --> 36:29.510
My Lord!

37:10.800 --> 37:11.710
Hong Ye?

37:15.670 --> 37:16.840
We meet again.

37:19.110 --> 37:20.440
It's been 10,000 years.

37:20.710 --> 37:21.510
Today,

37:21.760 --> 37:23.420
it's time to put an end to this.

37:46.070 --> 37:47.030
Xiao Yao.

37:48.880 --> 37:49.960
Xiao Yao.

37:51.760 --> 37:52.490
Who's there?

37:53.360 --> 37:56.210
Since the Sky Stone guided you here,

37:56.590 --> 37:59.060
it means you have a destiny to fulfill.

38:00.670 --> 38:02.270
You are the Heavenly Mother?

38:02.800 --> 38:05.330
How can I obtain
Hong Ye's primordial spirit?

38:06.110 --> 38:07.580
All primordial spirits

38:07.670 --> 38:09.670
are shaped by love and hate.

38:09.840 --> 38:11.680
Only love and hate can hurt them.

38:12.840 --> 38:15.270
To restore Hong Ye's spiritual power,

38:15.480 --> 38:18.610
you need only collect a single drop
of his tear-essence.

38:21.070 --> 38:23.050
How do I return after I get it?

38:23.260 --> 38:24.980
To go is to return.

38:25.400 --> 38:26.920
To come is to depart.

38:27.600 --> 38:28.590
Xiao Yao.

38:29.030 --> 38:30.630
Just remember—

38:30.880 --> 38:33.380
you are, and will always be, yourself.

38:48.710 --> 38:53.010
[100 years ago]

38:58.100 --> 38:59.360
Where am I?

39:01.420 --> 39:02.350
Is anyone there?

39:06.800 --> 39:07.880
Is anyone there?

39:16.710 --> 39:18.360
Is anyone there?

39:27.230 --> 39:28.190
So beautiful.

39:32.630 --> 39:33.440
Xiao Yao,

39:33.880 --> 39:34.920
is that you?

39:35.920 --> 39:37.320
A beauty that outshines the moon

39:37.320 --> 39:38.880
and puts the flowers to shame—

39:38.880 --> 39:40.880
it's you they talk about.

39:44.440 --> 39:45.400
Then who am I now?

39:49.440 --> 39:50.110
Who?

39:51.000 --> 39:52.090
Your Highness.

39:52.280 --> 39:53.410
It's time for lunch.

39:55.030 --> 39:55.880
Your Highness...
